  "sourceTitle": "Eggless Egg Salad",
  "sourceText": "Eggless Egg Salad\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Tuesday, December 1, 2009 - 11:17pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n2 lbs. tofu\n1 teaspoon turmeric\n1 teaspoon dry mustard\n1 tablespoon vegetable salt\n1 1/2 teaspoons celery seed\n1 1/2 teaspoons oregano\n1 1/2 teaspoons parsley\n1 teaspoon dill\n2 tablespoons mayonnaise or salad dressing\n1/2 cup minced onion\n3 stalks chopped celery\nSliced bread\nHerb butter\nAlfalfa sprouts\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Crumble drained tofu into large bowl. Add next 10 ingredients - mix well. Toast bread with herb butter. Spread mixture on bread - top with alfalfa sprouts. Makes approximately 20 sandwiches.",
